/* SECURITY AND PRIVACY */

NeMe has implemented numerous site security and GDPR compliant organisational measures to ensure the most complete protection of personal data processed through this website. However, Internet-based data transmissions may in principle have security gaps, so absolute protection may not be guaranteed. For this reason, every data subject is free to transfer personal data to us via alternative means.


/* TECHNOLOGY COLOPHON */

  Standards: HTML5, CSS3, Javascript, ARIA, RSS, Atom
  Server: Apache, MySQL, PHP

  Components:
    Software: Textpattern CMS, https://textpattern.com/
    Site source: https://github.com/colak/neme
    PHP-Textile: https://github.com/textile/php-textile
    echarts.js: https://echarts.apache.org/
    Javascript: Various custom javascripts


